&lt;li&gt;Architecture of Android device management and security solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of identity management solutions leveraging Platform SSO and enterprise directory integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of enterprise security infrastructure (SIEM, SOAR, IAM platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of Apple-centric zero-trust network frameworks such as Managed Device Attestation and WireGuard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of cross-platform security frameworks for enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of Apple and Android-centric security frameworks for enterprise environments&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of common and emerging threat vectors and risks specific to Apple and Android enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of advanced Jamf configurations including automation frameworks and API integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Custom workflows and automation for large-scale enterprise deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead response to complex RFPs requiring comprehensive Apple enterprise expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver technical presentations and executive workshops for enterprise prospects and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Professional Services, and Product teams to architect custom Apple enterprise solutions spanning management, endpoint security, and network security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strategic partner relationships with complementary solution providers (Apple, Microsoft, CrowdStrike, Zscaler, Okta)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver internal training and knowledge transfer on Apple enterprise best practices and emerging capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable implementation templates, automation tools, and methodologies for Apple enterprise deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an escalation point for Sales, Marketing, and Product teams on Apple enterprise matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Jamf as an Apple enterprise expert at industry events, conferences, and community forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation initiatives to address gaps in current solutions or where no solution exists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to product roadmap through field feedback and customer requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active participation in professional development opportunities and industry training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand cross-platform integration scenarios and coexistence strategies in enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Special projects assigned by management&lt;/li&gt;
